{title: 125 - Joy to the World}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #125 • ANTIOCH  (FROM HANDEL'S MESSIAH) • 8.6.9.7.7.10}
{lyricist: Isaac Watts}
{composer: Lowell Mason}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 125}
{meta: tune ANTIOCH  (FROM HANDEL'S MESSIAH)}
{meta: meter 8.6.9.7.7.10}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Joy to the world, [F]the [C/G]Lord [G7]is [C]come!
[F]Let earth receive [G]her King;
[C]Let every heart prepare Him room,
[C]And heaven and nature sing,
[C]And heaven [G]and [G7]nature [C]sing,
[C]And heaven, [F]and heaven [C/G]and nature sing.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Joy to the earth, [F]the [C/G]Savior reigns!
[F]Let men their [G]songs employ;
[C]While fields and floods, rocks, hills, and plains,
[C]Repeat the [G]sounding joy, Repeat [G7]the sounding [C]joy,
[C]Repeat, repeat [F]the [C/G]sounding joy.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]No more let sin [F]and [C/G]sorrow grow,
[F]Nor thorns infest [G]the ground;
[C]He comes to make His blessings flow
[C]Far as the [G]curse is found, Far [G7]as the curse [C]is found,
[C]Far as, far [F]as the [C/G]curse [G7]is [C]found.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]He rules the [F]world [C/G]with [G7]truth [C]and grace,
[F]And makes the [G]nations prove
[C]The glories of His righteousness,
[C]And wonders [G]of His love, And [G7]wonders of [C]His love,
[C]And wonders, [F]and wonders [C/G]of [G7]His [C]love.
{end_of_verse}
